{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791139080, "covers_from": "2026-10-04T18:38:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-04T18:39:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791139140, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-04T18:38:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 52683, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果你當選台北市長，勞工退休金會依據勞基法辦理嗎？\n如果不會，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.52,683", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T18:38:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 7684, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "中山路那邊常常發生車禍，希望改善交通問題", "display_name": "中山代表 No.7,684", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T18:38:18+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 14051, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "我想慢慢騎機車不帶安全帽的兜風，這應該不會影響別人吧", "display_name": "北投代表 No.14,051", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T18:38:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 42190, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "環境", "content": "逛夜市常常會看到地上有垃圾，為何不能編製夜間清潔員巡檢清理，很多國外觀光客逛夜市看到垃圾,真的很丟臉", "display_name": "大同代表 Allen 張", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T18:38:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 14947, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "育兒", "content": "六歲以上的孩子們瞬間沒有任何補助了，但教育費用其實是越來越高昂😩", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.14,947", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 7684, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.7,684", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 14051, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.14,051", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "